# Buboy - Unified Social Visit & Tambayan Smalltalk Timeline
# Voice: Energetic, innocent Bungisngis kid. Mainly English with light Filipino sprinkles.

label Greeting
if {Transaction_HasReactiveOpener}:
	Buboy: {Transaction_ReactiveOpener}
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	Buboy: Vroom, screech! Did you see how fast I sprinted from the acacia tree, Kuya?!
	Buboy: Just catching my breath by your counter, po, then I'm zooming right back out!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	Buboy: Kuya, look what I found near the tricycle stand!
	Buboy: Super shiny bottle cap without a single dent, gonna turn it into my new lucky pamato!
else:
	Buboy: Not buying anything right now, Kuya, [i]Damulag[/i] just wanted to peek if your shop cat is awake!
	Buboy: Hehe, see you around the road, po!
[signal arg="story_success"]
[end_timeline]

label Smalltalk
if {Transaction_VisitVar} < 34:
	Buboy: Kuya, I counted seven clouds while hanging out outside, and the biggest one looked just like pancit canton!
	Buboy: Gotta run, [i]Damulag[/i]'s ready to roll!
elif {Transaction_VisitVar} < 67:
	Buboy: Knees are fully recharged, Kuya! Gonna race the next tricycle back to the corner, bye po!
else:
	Buboy: Salamat for the shade, Kuya! Holler if you ever need the fastest kid on the road!
[end_timeline]
